{"id":10922,"date":"2024-09-16T17:12:58","date_gmt":"2024-09-16T17:12:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=10922"},"modified":"2025-08-29T10:28:21","modified_gmt":"2025-08-29T10:28:21","slug":"top-5-commercial-contractors-in-portland","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/top-5-commercial-contractors-in-portland\/","title":{"rendered":"Top 5 Commercial Contractors in Portland"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>&#8220;Top 5 Commercial Contractors in Portland<\/em>&#8220;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/construction-construction-vehicles-nominated-2023-11-27-05-35-18-utc-1024x548.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10926\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Choosing the Right Commercial Contractor Matters<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When embarking on a commercial construction project in Oregon, selecting the right contractor is crucial to your project\u2019s success. Whether you\u2019re building a new office space, renovating a retail location, or developing a large-scale commercial property, the contractor you choose will impact your timeline, budget, and overall outcome. Commercial construction projects require specialized expertise, particularly in managing complex regulations, permits, and industry standards. With the right commercial contractor, you can ensure that your project is completed efficiently and to the highest standards.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Factors to Consider When Hiring a Commercial Contractor<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Oregon is home to many skilled commercial contractors, but finding one with the right blend of experience, reliability, and project management skills can be challenging. It&#8217;s important to vet potential contractors thoroughly, looking into their track record with similar projects and ensuring they can handle the unique demands of your specific build.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When considering a contractor for your commercial project, it\u2019s also essential to think about the scope of the work and how it will affect your business operations. For example, some contractors specialize in minimizing disruption to ongoing operations, which is critical for businesses that need to remain open during renovations. Additionally, the right contractor will have a deep understanding of local building codes and regulations, ensuring your project stays compliant and avoids costly delays.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Importance of Communication and Networking<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Another key factor is communication. A strong contractor-client relationship is built on clear and frequent communication. Your contractor should keep you informed at every stage of the project, from initial planning through final inspections. This transparency not only helps keep the project on track but also ensures that any issues are addressed promptly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Working with a commercial contractor who has a robust network of subcontractors and suppliers is also a plus. This network can help streamline the construction process, ensuring materials arrive on time and that skilled workers are available when needed. It\u2019s also worth asking about a contractor\u2019s experience with sustainable building practices if your project has environmental goals.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Top 5 Commercial Contractors in Portland<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Below, we\u2019ve compiled a list of the top 5 commercial contractors in Portland. These companies are known for their excellence in commercial construction, consistently delivering quality results while meeting deadlines and staying within budget.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/unnamed-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10881\" style=\"width:356px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Walsh Construction Co. \u2013 (503) 222-4375 \u2013 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.walshconstruction.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.walshconstruction.com\/<br><br><\/a><em>4.9 stars \u2013 16 Google reviews<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Located:<\/strong> 2905 SW 1st Ave, Portland, OR 97201<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Specializes in:<\/strong> Affordable Housing&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/unnamed-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10882\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hoffman Corporation Company \u2013 (503) 221-8811 \u2013 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.hoffmancorp.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.hoffmancorp.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>4.5 stars \u2013 12 Google reviews&nbsp;<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Located:<\/strong> 805 SW Broadway Ste 2100, Portland, OR 97205<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Specializes in:<\/strong> Largest Commercial General Contractor<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/unnamed-4.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10883\" style=\"width:171px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Colas Construction \u2013 (503) 292-4025&nbsp; \u2013 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.colasconstruction.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.colasconstruction.com\/<\/a>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>4.7 stars \u2013 10 Google reviews<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Located:<\/strong> 1419 NW 14th Ave, Portland, OR 97209&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Specializes in:<\/strong> Commercial<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/unnamed-5.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10884\" style=\"width:260px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">LMC Construction \u2013 (503) 646-0521 \u2013 <a href=\"https:\/\/lmcconstruction.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/lmcconstruction.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>4.6 stars \u2013 15 Google reviews&nbsp;<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Located:<\/strong> 19200 SW Teton Ave, Tualatin, OR 97062<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Specializes in:<\/strong> Multi Family Commercial<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/unnamed-6.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10885\" style=\"width:284px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Turner Construction Co -(503) 226-9825 \u2013 <a href=\"https:\/\/pence.net\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/pence.net\/<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>4.0 stars \u2013 12 Google reviews<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Located:<\/strong> 5400 Meadows Rd, Lake Oswego, OR 97035<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Specializes in:<\/strong> Commercial<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/workspace-at-the-construction-site-2023-11-27-05-24-43-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10928\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Choosing the right commercial contractor in Oregon is critical to the success of your project. By focusing on companies with proven experience, strong reputations, and a commitment to quality, you can ensure that your commercial construction venture is in capable hands. Each of the contractors listed above brings unique strengths to the table, making them excellent choices for businesses looking to complete their projects on time and to the highest standards.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re developing a new commercial space or upgrading an existing facility, the right contractor will guide you through the complexities of the construction process, helping you navigate permits, regulations, and logistical challenges. With the expertise of a top-tier commercial contractor, your Oregon project will not only meet but exceed your expectations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">And if you\u2019re also looking for a trusted partner for <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us-2\/\" title=\"\">general contracting<\/a> or a kitchen and bathroom remodel, <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/\" title=\"\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a> is here to bring your vision to life with professionalism and attention to detail.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>&#8220;Top 5 Commercial Contractors in Portland&#8220; Why Choosing the Right Commercial Contractor Matters When embarking on a commercial construction project in Oregon, selecting the right contractor is crucial to your project\u2019s success. Whether you\u2019re building a new office space, renovating a retail location, or developing a large-scale commercial property, the contractor you choose will impact [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":10927,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[31],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-10922","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-contractors-guides"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/10922","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=10922"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/10922\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":13393,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/10922\/revisions\/13393"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=10922"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=10922"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=10922"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}